      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ATWORTHY ROCKER (8) showed great determination at her latest appearance over 1740m at Riverina Paceway when she scored by a neck after being on the pace throughout. Drawn to enjoy a nice run, with luck possibly playing a role at some point. Meets a similar line up so she can keep the ball rolling. GOOD TALK (4) showed plenty of courage at his latest appearance over 1740m at this track when he scored by 2 metres after being on the speed from the outset. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Primary contender in a similar race. KARINYA SOPHIE (5) is in the mix following a fifth at her most recent appearance over 1740m at this track. A WISH GRANTED (7) good effort to finish in the money two back then broke last start but still scored by 4.5 metres over 1770m at Canberra. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go his way at some stage. Live chance again in a similar assignment.",
